{
  "name": "dsh-product-dev",
  "version": "0.2.4",
  "description": "DSH 产品开发插件：从零做产品、加功能、修 bug，也可单独做设计、文档修改、复审或验收。内置需求与 PRD、原型与界面设计、架构图表、代码探索、开发测试与调试、工程闸门、独立审查和 PR 交付；按项目规则与授权推进，保留产物和验证证据，减少遗漏与交接断层。支持工程套件安装升级和获授权的发布，实际执行依赖宿主工具。",
  "author": "YuanLumen",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/ac0033/skills/tree/main/product-dev",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/ac0033/skills.git",
    "directory": "product-dev/dsh"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/ac0033/skills/issues"
  },
  "license": "(MIT AND Apache-2.0)",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "skills",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0",
    "dsh": ">=0.2.2-rc.1 <0.3.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "skills",
    "agent-skills",
    "product-development",
    "workflow"
  ]
}
